# Android

- Kotlin + Jetpack Compose + Hilt + Room + Media3
- UI in `ui/`, domain use cases test-first (JUnit 5 + MockK + Turbine)
- `MediaSessionService` for background playback
- SessionManager: offline grace, refresh only online
- OkHttp Authenticator for token refresh (single-flight)
- EncryptedSharedPreferences for tokens
